t wl_hf-creative-menu\"><a href=\"https:\/\/refreshwellbeing.com.au\/our-story\/\" class = \"wl_hf-menu-item\">Our Story<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul><\/nav>\r\n\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0471938 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0471938\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b5a3d06 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b5a3d06\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">OUR STORY\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c3ee40 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5c3ee40\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Welcome to Refresh Wellbeing, where we believe in the magical dance of a healthy mind, body and spirit \u2013 your ultimate recipe for radiant living!<\/p><p>Refresh Wellbeing is a place to retreat from the hustle of life. To help you bring back balance and harmony through self care.<\/p><p>In our STUDIO Space, we offer a variety of Group Yoga classes as well as Private Yoga classes and hold workshop and events which will inspire you.\u200b<\/p><p>Refresh Wellbeing isn&#8217;t just a place \u2013 it&#8217;s a promise. A promise to nurture your soul, invigorate your body, and ignite your mind. Our mission is to be your compass, your nourishment, and your cosmic spark. Let&#8217;s embrace well-being, hand in hand, and paint your life with vibrant hues of balance and joy.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f94586 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3f94586\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4191862 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4191862\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;video&quot;,&quot;background_video_link&quot;:&quot;https:\\\/\\\/refreshwellbeing.com.au\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2025\\\/05\\\/video-01-file.mp4&quot;,&quot;background_play_on_mobile&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-video-container\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<video class=\"elementor-background-video-hosted\" autoplay muted playsinline loop><\/video>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-91ca93d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"91ca93d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-752f47f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"752f47f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">12 Pillars of Refresh Wellbeing<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-41af1a1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"41af1a1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>1) We believe that life is meant to be lived in its full potential which requires an awareness, an appreciation and a relationship with the planet and the people, animals and plants on it.<\/p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">2) We believe in living outside of the box. That possibility is endless and opportunity is bountiful.<\/span><\/span><\/p><p>3) We believe in growth and evolution not in the pursuit to become better selves but to become our true selves simply by surrendering, trusting and accepting who we are-just as we are.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-77eb89f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"77eb89f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-91093d0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"91093d0\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-374be21 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"374be21\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\">4) We believe that the meaning of life is in the question itself. Asking questions, through curiosity and excitement and allowing that magical childlike essence to guide us through the unknown where synchronicity and flow happens naturally.<\/span><\/span><\/p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\">5) We believe in living great lives, which is measured not by what we achieve but by how our state of being is within the experience.<\/span><\/span><\/p><div id=\"comp-kipzhnhf\" class=\"HcOXKn c9GqVL QxJLC3 lq2cno YQcXTT comp-kipzhnhf wixui-rich-text\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\">6) We believe that by connecting with others, with nature and with ourselves we can find peace, happiness and a life of fulfilment.<\/span><\/span><\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-60bb5d0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"60bb5d0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;video&quot;,&quot;background_video_link&quot;:&quot;https:\\\/\\\/refreshwellbeing.com.au\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2025\\\/05\\\/video-02-file.mp4&quot;,&quot;background_play_on_mobile&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-video-container\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<video class=\"elementor-background-video-hosted\" autoplay muted playsinline loop><\/video>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-202fafc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"202fafc\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-caea5a4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"caea5a4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;video&quot;,&quot;background_video_link&quot;:&quot;https:\\\/\\\/refreshwellbeing.com.au\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2025\\\/05\\\/video-03-file.mp4&quot;,&quot;background_play_on_mobile&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-video-container\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<video class=\"elementor-background-video-hosted\" autoplay muted playsinline loop><\/video>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-60ff311 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"60ff311\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3238d5d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3238d5d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">7) We believe in truth and kind communication.<\/span><\/span><\/p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\">8) We believe in Being and that out of being is where our dreams manifest.<\/p><div id=\"comp-kipzk7x7\" class=\"HcOXKn SxM0TO QxJLC3 lq2cno YQcXTT comp-kipzk7x7 wixui-rich-text\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">9) We believe in community and the support of like-minded individuals who inspire one another to evolve.<\/span><\/span><\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dabe0f4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"dabe0f4\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c93eb3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5c93eb3\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-502587a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"502587a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">10) We believe in laughter and play and having grand adventures-both in our inner world and outer world.<\/span><\/span><\/p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">11) We believe that life doesn\u2019t have to be hard work but that the work you put into it is what enlivens you.<\/span><\/span><\/p><div id=\"comp-kipzhnhf\" class=\"HcOXKn c9GqVL QxJLC3 lq2cno YQcXTT c